{"id":"n29724-1-13","stage":0,"title":"방 · 房间","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29724-1-13-1","ko":"우리 여기에 소파를 놓는 게 어때?","zh":"我们在这里放张沙发怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소파를","meaning":"沙发","explanation":"소파：沙发；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소파","audio":"/audio/d6dab8e7a021c768cde2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62508","senseId":"1","lemma":"소파","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놓는","meaning":"放，放置","explanation":"놓다：放，放置；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"9","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"d6dab8e7a021c768","term":"소파","zh":"沙发","audio":"/audio/d6dab8e7a021c768cde2.mp3","entryId":"62508","definition":"可以背靠着坐的又长又软的椅子。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"放，放置","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"89534","definition":"把原本手里抓或握着的物体置于某处。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/a39f2127d1fb2d640186.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29724-1-13-2","ko":"방이 너무 좁아서 소파는 못 놓지.","zh":"房间太窄了，放不下沙发。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방이","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좁아서","meaning":"窄，狭窄","explanation":"좁다：窄，狭窄；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"좁다","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75801","senseId":"2","lemma":"좁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소파는","meaning":"沙发","explanation":"소파：沙发；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"소파","audio":"/audio/d6dab8e7a021c768cde2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62508","senseId":"1","lemma":"소파","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":